# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LinkedIn Skills — Environment Configuration Template
# All variables below are 100% OPTIONAL.
# The bundle works completely free out-of-the-box in Tier 0 (manual
# copy-paste mode) with none of these set.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1. PUBLORA (Auto-Publishing & Scheduling to LinkedIn)
# Free Tier: 15 posts/month (no credit card required)
# Sign up: https://app.publora.com/signup?utm_source=github&utm_medium=env-example&utm_campaign=linkedin-skills
# How to get your API Key: Dashboard -> Settings (gear icon) -> API -> Create Key
PUBLORA_API_KEY=sk_your_publora_api_key_here

# LinkedIn Platform Connection ID (format: linkedin-XXXXXXXXX)
# How to get it: In Publora dashboard -> Channels -> click your connected LinkedIn account.
# Copy the entire ID including the "linkedin-" prefix.
LINKEDIN_PLATFORM_ID=linkedin-your_channel_id_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. APIFY (Auto-Scrapes LinkedIn Posts, Comments & Engagers by URL)
# Free Tier: $5/month of free credit (~1,000 to 5,000 scrapes/month)
# Sign up: https://console.apify.com/sign-up
# Token:   https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations
# Note: Without this, skills simply ask you to copy-paste the text ($0).
APIFY_TOKEN=apify_api_your_token_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. PIXFARO (AI Images, Branded Overlays & Quote-Cards)
# Sign up: https://api.pixfaro.com/signup?ref=linkedin-skills
# Key format: pf_live_...
# Note: Without this, skills draft the visual prompt for you to generate
# via Google Gemini, Imagen, Midjourney, or DALL-E manually ($0).
PIXFARO_TOKEN=pf_live_your_token_here

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Verification Command:
# Run: python scripts/check_config.py
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
